Terms & Conditions Terms & Conditions Welcome to My Recipes!

By using this application, you agree to the following terms and conditions:

1. Public Visibility of Recipes:
Any recipes you upload (including names, ingredients, instructions, links, and uploaded photos) will be shared and visible to all app users in the Explore tab.

2. User Account & Data:
Your saved recipes are securely linked to your account. We retain user preferences to ensure smooth synchronization across launches.

3. Content Guidelines:
Users must refrain from uploading offensive, copyrighted, or inappropriate content or images. We reserve the right to remove non-compliant content.

4. Changes to Terms:
These terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use of the app constitutes acceptance of any modified terms. I Understand
